<p>Should this really be considered a rewrite? The only similarity it really has with my original skip is that it's a website that lets you go to an anomalous theatre.</p>
<p>That said, I really did enjoy it. The testing log was fun and sweet, and Randall's speech at the end really struck home. Other people have already said what I wanted to say, so I'll shut up and give you an upvote.</p>
<p>However, I looked at an earlier version of the draft in your sandbox and I do think there was some wasted potential. I especially liked how in that version Randall had to get through a ton of hoops and loops to get his project approved, and became angry at the foundation for fucking it all up. Is there a particular reason you changed that? I still do like the direction you took it in.</p>

